<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Studio No Frame is a Berlin-based creative studio working across art
      direction, exhibition design, art production, project management,
      curation, and consulting. We collaborate with artists, cultural
      institutions, NGOs, project spaces, and universities to realize
      interdisciplinary and socially engaged projects.
    </p>
    <p>
      With a flexible structure and a diverse team, we approach each project
      with care, curiosity, and a strong emphasis on dialogue. Our practice
      values collective thinking, experimental methods, and process-oriented
      making.
    </p>
    <p>
      We have worked with a wide range of partners including Haus der Kulturen
      der Welt, Istanbul Foundation for Culture and Arts (IKSV), Istanbul
      Modern, Ludwig Museum, MAXXI Rome, Pera Museum, SALT, La Biennale di
      Venezia – Venice Architecture Biennale, Istanbul Biennial, Istanbul
      Design Biennial, and Timișoara Biennial. We have also collaborated with
      artists such as Abbas Zahedi, Ahmet Öğüt, Amy Lien &amp; Enzo Camacho,
      Ayşe Erkmen, Füsun Onur, Gülsüm Karamustafa, Leman Darıcıoğlu, Monira Al
      Qadiri, Raul Walch, and Tomás Saraceno.
    </p>
    <p>We believe in open conversations and sustainable production processes.</p>
    <p>
      Want to see our work or collaborate with us? If you'd like to explore a
      project together, please <a href="mailto:hello@studionoframe.com">get in
      touch</a> and request our portfolio.
    </p>
    <p>
      Looking to join us? If you're interested in an internship, you can find
      all details <a href="mailto:hello@studionoframe.com">here</a>. →
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
